<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7a" title="In CyberSOCEval: Benchmarking LLMs Capabilities for Malware Analysis and Threat Intelligence Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Synthetic Data Generation Code for Threat Intelligence Reasoning Benchmark</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
