<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">CyberSOCEval: Benchmarking LLMs Capabilities for Malware Analysis and Threat Intelligence Reasoning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Lauren Deason*†
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Adam Bali†
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Ciprian Bejean‡
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
