<span id="S3.T1.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Remote Access Trojan providing attackers with persistent remote access to a victim’s computer using techniques including polymorphism, rootkit capabilities, vulnerability exploitation, and legitimate tool use.</span>
</span></td></tr>
