<span id="S3.T1.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T1.2.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">INFOSTEALERS</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S3.T1.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T1.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Infiltrates systems to extract sensitive information such as login credentials, financial information, etc. using techniques such as keylogging, for grabbing, and network traffic interception.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S3.T1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T1.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T1.2.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">UM UNHOOKING</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
