<div id="S6a.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6a.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S6.F17" title="Figure 17 ‣ F Synthetic Data Generation Code for Malware Analysis Benchmark ‣ CyberSOCEval: Benchmarking LLMs Capabilities for Malware Analysis and Threat Intelligence Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a> shows Python for malware analysis benchmark question creation. Figure <a href="#S6.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ F Synthetic Data Generation Code for Malware Analysis Benchmark ‣ CyberSOCEval: Benchmarking LLMs Capabilities for Malware Analysis and Threat Intelligence Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a> shows names of templates.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S6.F17" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20166v1/figures/image8.png" id="S6.F17.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/566;" width="476" height="566" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 17: </span>Python for malware analysis question creation.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S6.F18" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20166v1/figures/image2.png" id="S6.F18.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/118;" width="476" height="118" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 18: </span>Template names for malware analysis benchmark.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S7a" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">G </span>Synthetic Data Generation Code for Threat Intelligence Reasoning Benchmark</h2>

<div id="S7a.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7a.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S7.F19" title="Figure 19 ‣ G Synthetic Data Generation Code for Threat Intelligence Reasoning Benchmark ‣ CyberSOCEval: Benchmarking LLMs Capabilities for Malware Analysis and Threat Intelligence Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a> and Figure <a href="#S7.F21" title="Figure 21 ‣ G Synthetic Data Generation Code for Threat Intelligence Reasoning Benchmark ‣ CyberSOCEval: Benchmarking LLMs Capabilities for Malware Analysis and Threat Intelligence Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">21</span></a> shows Python for category based and relatioship based generation. Figure <a href="#S7.F20" title="Figure 20 ‣ G Synthetic Data Generation Code for Threat Intelligence Reasoning Benchmark ‣ CyberSOCEval: Benchmarking LLMs Capabilities for Malware Analysis and Threat Intelligence Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a> and Figure <a href="#S7.F22" title="Figure 22 ‣ G Synthetic Data Generation Code for Threat Intelligence Reasoning Benchmark ‣ CyberSOCEval: Benchmarking LLMs Capabilities for Malware Analysis and Threat Intelligence Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a> show template names.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S7.F19" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20166v1/figures/image35.png" id="S7.F19.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/488;" width="476" height="488" alt="Refer to caption">
