</figure>
<figure id="S7.F20" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20166v1/figures/image36.png" id="S7.F20.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/158;" width="476" height="158" alt="Refer to caption">
